    <string name="about_unofficial_body">FuelUp is an independent project. It is not an official app and is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Italian Ministry of Enterprises and Made in Italy (MIMIT).</string>
    <string name="about_prices_title">About the prices</string>
    <string name="about_prices_body">Prices are those in force at 08:00 on the data date shown in the app, as reported by the stations to the Ministry. Each morning the Ministry publishes the prices in force at 08:00 on the previous day. They are not real time: always check the price at the pump.</string>
